  "description": "**This is a Promotional Oneshot for a Novel!**\n\n19 year old, Choi Woogi fell in love with the outdated RPG game called \"Justice\".  \nNow, as a 20 year old adult he's still devoted to fanboying over the game and keeping up his gaming lifestyle, it was a normal day.\n\n[Chunghoon: no, i dont want to, tora is an old man LOL]  \n[Chunghoon: im a lively twenty y.o]  \n[Tora: age... is just a number]  \n[Tora: i'm only 27... even the president can't stop my investment in you]  \n[Tora: please lower your standards just this once]\n\nHe meets a popular game streamer named 'Tora', through a fixed party by fate. He also happens to receive an 'infinite dash' from him which no other gamer has, leading Woogi to a strange contract relationship with Tora.\n\nWhile living an ordinary gamer life, our 'Limited Time Love' has begun!\n\n**Original Novel:** [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3822000018) | [Kakao](https://page.kakao.com/content/59201121)",
